      "text": "This practice-oriented course utilizes popular testing tools and environments such as JUnit, Selenium, Postman, Jenkins, and JMeter, enabling students to understand and apply both manual and automated testing. Students will learn how to set up testing environments, use automation frameworks, and write test scripts for APIs, user interfaces, and system performance. Upon completion, students will be able to design and deploy testing processes for real-world software applications, report bugs, evaluate product quality, and collaborate effectively with development teams to improve software reliability and performance.",
